          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 5.845719,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## Medical procedures\n\n- 93000: resting 12-lead electrocardiogram, with the doctor's reading of it - $65\n- 94010: spirometry - $85\n- 93784: 24-hour ambulatory blood pressure monitoring - $140\n- 81002: urine dipstick test done in the clinic - $15\n- 69210: ear wax removal, per ear - $75\n- 17110: wart freezing (cryotherapy), up to 14 warts in one session - $90",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 24,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.22169171,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": 4.371992,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
